Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:03:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(1978年感恩节）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(1862年感恩节）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(1988年感恩节）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(1915年感恩节）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  这真是史上最棒的  感恩节大餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, that was the best Thanksgiving dinner ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好吃了  你把我们都快撑死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was so good. I think you killed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我连一口都吃不下了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't possibly eat another bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要吃甜的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人想看电视吗  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does anyone wanna watch TV? Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你的遥控器按不动了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, your remote doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你得把它拿起来对准\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you have to lift it and point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you know what we should all do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该来玩感恩告白游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should play that game where everyone says one thing they're thankful for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说  感谢今年的秋天这么美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I... I am thankful for this beautiful fall we've been having.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得真好  好甜蜜  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very nice. Sweet, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天我在车站等公车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, the other day, I was at the bus stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突然吹来一阵可爱的秋风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and this lovely fall breeze came in out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把一个女生的裙子吹了起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and blew this chick's skirt right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我还要感谢丁字裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, which reminds me, I'm also thankful for thongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第08集  感恩节大回顾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E08 The One With The Thanksgiving Flashbacks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与其说它是内裤  不如说是一种伟大工程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not so much an underpant as it is a feat of engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,料子那么少  效果却那么大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's amazing how much they can do with so little material.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它还会戏弄你  有穿吗  没穿吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the way they play with your mind. I mean, is it there? Is it not there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你还在碎碎念吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you aware that you're still talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有人要感谢  丁字裤以外的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is anyone thankful for anything else besides a thong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道要比较感谢离婚呢  还是感谢被赶出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what to pick. Am I more thankful for my divorce, or my eviction?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为  你会没有感谢的呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, see, and I didn't think you'd be able to come up with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  这是最惨的一次感恩节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. It's just this is the worst Thanksgiving ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行  我才是悲惨感恩节盟主\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. I am the king of bad Thanksgivings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能挟失败的婚姻空降  抢了我的宝座\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't just swoop in here with your bad marriage...and take that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又要说你爸妈离婚的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not gonna tell the whole story  about how your parents got divorced, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样嘛  我想听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. I want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有钱德扫兴  就不算感恩节了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It wouldn't be Thanksgiving without Chandler bumming us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这跟游行一样  是一项传统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a tradition, like the parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果游行也出柜离家  抛妻弃子的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If the parade decided it was gay, moved out and abandoned its entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, Chandler, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸和我要离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just because your father and I are getting a divorce...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不代表我们不爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...doesn't mean we don't love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是代表他上床的对像是男仆  而不是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It just means he would rather sleep with the houseboy than with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.27,0:03:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小少爷还要火鸡吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}More turkey, Mr. Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  你的更惨  你是悲惨感恩节盟主\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right, yours is worse. You are the king of bad Thanksgivings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不一定  我有一次更惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know about that. I've got one that's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惨过 "小少爷还要火鸡" 吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Worse than:"More turkey, Mr. Chandler?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小少爷跟仆人有仇吗  对  我的更惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did the little rich boy had a problem with the butler? Yes, mine's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要绷带  还要绷带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}More bandages! More bandages!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再给我一些绷带  这个人快死…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, can I get some more bandages in here? This man is... Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今生的才算  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In this life, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今生是吧  那钱德的比较惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this life.Oh, okay. No, Chandler's is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得前世的事一定很酷吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, it must be so cool remembering stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都没有前世的记忆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have any past life memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有  你是新生命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course, you don't, sweetie. You're brand-new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道摩妮卡最惨的感恩节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know Monica's worst Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个就别提了  说嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, let's not tell this story. Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no! I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是摩妮卡的火鸡  卡在乔伊头上那次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the one where Joey got Monica's turkey stuck on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么  乔伊头上卡了只火鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What? Joey got a turkey stuck on his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实不是那样  其实就是那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, it's not like it sounds. It's exactly like it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(1992年感恩节）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪  我知道  它卡住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I know.It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心台阶  它怎么会跑到你头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Step. How did it get on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我套上去想吓钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I put it on to scare Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  摩妮卡一定会气死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Monica's going to totally freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快帮我拿下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then help me get it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面好臭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, it smells really bad in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然很臭  你的头塞在动物尸体的屁股里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course it smells really bad. You have your head up a dead animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你替火鸡涂 … 我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, did you get the turkey...? Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁  乔伊啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is that? It's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么  你是在搞笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Is this supposed to be funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是搞笑  是吓人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's not supposed to be funny. It's supposed to be scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上给我拿掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get that off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿不掉  卡住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't. It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管  我爸妈的20个客人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't care. That turkey has to feed 20 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能就着你的头吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're not going to eat it off your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先别急  大家一起想办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on, okay? Let's just all think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I got it. Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样  你拉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. You pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽量把腿撑开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna spread the legs as wide as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  现在不要闹  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, now is not the time. Yeah. Sorry. Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  数到三  一  二  三\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, count to three. One, two...three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了  我吓到你了  看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It worked. I scared you. I knew it. Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大哥  我在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm over here, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you are. Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吓到你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I scared you. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来真的很白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You did look like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴的不只是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I wasn't the only one who looked like an idiot, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯有一次想说冬南瓜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember when Ross tried to say "butternut squash"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果讲成南冬瓜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it came out, "squatternut bosh"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确  一样白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我最惨的感恩节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it. That's my worst Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  瑞秋说的不可能是那次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait. That can't be the one that Rachel was talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她根本不知道那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because she didn't even know that that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以是哪次  哪次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what's yours? What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的不想提这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I really don't wanna tell this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讲嘛  莫妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重温悲惨的回忆  是感恩节的精神\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Reliving past pain and getting depressed is what Thanksgiving's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我觉得是  还有原住民的帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, for me, anyway. And, of course, the Indians.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最不希望我提的绝对是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, of all people, you do not want me to tell this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  应该是瑞秋来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, I think Rachel's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感恩节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不快乐  奇普和我分手了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not for me.Chip and I broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.01,0:07:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Why? Well, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸妈不是要出门  奇普不是要来么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how my parents are out of town, and Chip was gonna come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:08:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你要给他你的花芯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. And you were gonna give him, you know...your "flower."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你能不能直接说做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Monica, can you just call it sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那样讲让我浑身发毛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It really creeps me out when you call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, and by the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在做的时候  男人的那里不叫他的温柔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...while we're at it, a guy's thing is not called his "tenderness."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.Hi, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感恩节快乐  你也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy Thanksgiving. You too, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  这是钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, everyone...this is Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的室友兼我们乐团的主唱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My roommate and lead singer of our band. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.51,0:08:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是摩妮卡  我是罗斯的妹妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. This is Monica.Hi, I'm Ross' little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你来   钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so glad you could come, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有很多吃的  希望你饿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've got plenty of food, so I hope you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈  钱德痛恨感恩节  他不吃感恩节食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Mom, no, no, Chandler hates Thanksgiving and doesn't eat any Thanksgiving food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还真是欢迎啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Well, I'm so glad you brought him here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  我可以帮你煮起司通心面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler, If you want, I can make you some macaroni and cheese for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要当年的清教徒没吃  我就吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As long as the Pilgrims didn't eat it, then I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, uh, Rach...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去上大学不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does it...? Does it feel weird around here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会不会觉得怪怪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, since I've been away at college?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒不会  那就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.No, not really. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇普居然为了那个花痴南西  而甩了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh! I cannot believe Chip dumped me for that slut, Nancy Branson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不跟他约会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am never going out with him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他再怎么求我也没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care how much he begs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有了南西  应该不会求你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think his begging days are over, now that he's with Nancy Branson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我受够高中男生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I've just had it with high-school boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们全是些又笨又呆的小毛头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're just silly.They're just silly, stupid boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.19,0:10:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要开始跟男人交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna start dating men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,茱蒂  对不起  我找不到你和杰克要的碗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I'm sorry, Judy.I couldn't find that bowl you and Jack were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫爸爸妈妈吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call them Mom and Dad, you loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起司通心面好吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you like the macaroni and cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃  你应该去当厨师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. It was great. You should be a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜怎样  南西很花痴的传闻都是假的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guess what. All this stuff about Nancy Branson being a slut was all a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以奇普甩了她  他今天晚上想来找我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chip dumped her, and he wants to come over to my house tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that is so great. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  要是你和奇普晚上做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, gosh. Listen, if you and Chip do it tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要把细节都告诉我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...um, promise me you'll tell me everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然  其实也没什么  我们应该有做过一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, totally, totally. It's not that big a deal. We already kind of did it once, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但这回你一定能确定  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, but this time you're gonna definitely know whether or not you did it.I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇普还保证  这次会持续一整首歌的长度\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and Chip promised that this time it would last at least for an entire song.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我晚上打算约瑞秋出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm thinking of asking Rachel out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弹我们上周写的那首歌给她听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, maybe playing her that song we wrote last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"忧愁的背包"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Emotional Knapsack"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过不要拖太久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, uh, but don't take long, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还要去试用假身份证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because we're testing our fake ID's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧  克里夫艾维瑞兹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right, Clifford Alvarez?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  罗兰陈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, Roland Cheng...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果一切顺利  我们搞不好不会回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if things go well, I may be out with her all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  别丢下我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, don't do that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  你可以留下来  我爸妈不会介意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. It's cool, you can stay here. My parents won't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我不想整晚  跟你的肥猪妹妹在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not that. I don't wanna be stuck here all night with your fat sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  把这些派吃完吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, why don't you finish off these pies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:12:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冰箱里塞不下了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have any more room in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.51,0:12:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,茱蒂  你成功了  她终于吃不下了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Judy, you did it. She's finally full.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说你肥  我完全不记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I called you fat? I don't even remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  真的  我那时候很愚蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so sorry. I really am. But, come on, I was an idiot back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还在"轰"的演唱会上  冲上台大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I rushed the stage at a Wham! Concert, for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然说她肥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can't believe you called her fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然让乔治麦可赏你耳光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you let George Michael slap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉  我太差劲了  真是对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am really sorry.That is so terrible. I'm so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我说的不是那次感恩节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, that's not the Thanksgiving I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是 不是  我说的是…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it was. No, it wasn't. It was actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  感恩节结束了  准备过圣诞节吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ok. Thanksgiving's over. Get ready for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁要去买圣诞树\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who wants to get a Christmas tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有最可爱的圣诞节故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. I have the cutest Christmas story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想听摩妮卡的感恩节故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We wanna hear Monica's Thanksgiving story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:13:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的故事里有小矮人断成两截  不过随便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine, all right. Mine had a dwarf that got broke in half.But, you know, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你妈说你又转系了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Rachel, your mom tells me you changed your major again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没办法  心理系馆旁边很难停车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, I had to.There was never any parking by the Psychology building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Rachel. Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的新鼻子真漂亮  杰克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Love your new nose. Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样  威尔森医生是个艺术家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Dr. Wolfson's an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他帮我点掉一堆痣  你要看吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He removed my mole cluster.Want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去开  不  让我去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, God. Please, let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感恩节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy Thanksgiving. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的发型变了好多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, your hair sure is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚才还在讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we were just talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前真的好蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't we can't believe how stupid we used to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.02,0:13:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, uh, where's Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在楼上  摩妮卡  快下来  人都到齐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's upstairs. Monica. Come down, everyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  瑞秋  和那个痛恨感恩节的男生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, Rachel and the boy who hates Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Chandler.Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我的衣服有脏东西吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter? Is there something on my dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你变了好多  看起来好漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just... You look so different. Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那件裙子  那个身材\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That dress, that body...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  摩妮卡瘦了  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes, Monica is thin. It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们比较关心罗斯的新女友  妈…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But what we really want to hear about is Ross' new girlfriend.Oh, Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  她叫卡萝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Um, ahem, her name is Carol...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很漂亮  很聪明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and she's really pretty and smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是长曲棍球和高尔夫球校队  很厉害吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, she's on the lacrosse team and the golf team.Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她两个校队都打\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She plays for both teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   那就晚餐见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Chandler, I guess I'll see you at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
